  "title": "Strawberry-Banana Bread with Walnuts",
  "description": "A one-bowl recipe for strawberry-banana bread with walnuts uses applesauce to replace some of the oil and makes plenty to share, yielding two full-size loaves plus a mini loaf.",
  "authors": [
    "Abrux"
  ],
  "date_published": "2007-08-13T16:13:27-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-04-26T16:51:36-04:00",
